    "body": "## Motivation\n\nFixes #40728. Requests that send `input_embeds` through `/open_session` currently reach session request construction without token IDs, causing a `TypeError` before the request is scheduled.\n\n## Modifications\n\n- Generate placeholder token IDs for first-turn session embedding requests, matching the normal request path.\n- Forward `input_embeds` when constructing the session `Req`.\n- Add regression coverage for streaming and non-streaming sessions.\n\nLocal validation:\n\n- `pre-commit run --files python/sglang/srt/session/session_controller.py test/registered/unit/mem_cache/test_session_token_share_unit.py`: passed.\n- `python3 -m py_compile python/sglang/srt/session/session_controller.py test/registered/unit/mem_cache/test_session_token_share_unit.py`: passed.\n- A source-level regression harness reproduced the reported `TypeError` before the change and passed for both streaming modes after the change, verifying placeholder IDs and preserved embeddings.\n- `PYTHONPATH=python python3 test/registered/unit/mem_cache/test_session_token_share_unit.py`: could not start because `orjson` is not installed in the local environment.\n\n## Accuracy Tests\n\nNot applicable; this request-construction fix does not change model accuracy.\n\n## Speed Tests and Profiling\n\nNot applicable; no model or scheduling benchmark changes are included.\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [x] Format code according to the contribution guide.\n- [x] Add unit tests according to the contribution guide.\n- [x] Follow the SGLang code style guidance.\n\n## Review and Merge Process\n\nReady for review.\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:x: [Run #35836845586](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/35836845586)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #35836844994](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/35836844994)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -